### Connected Accounts (Stripe Connect) Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### List Connected Accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connected-accounts/
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Create Express Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connected-accounts/create-express
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "type": "express",
  "country": "US",
  "email": "business@example.com",
  "business_type": "individual",
  "business_name": "Test Business"
}

### Create Account Link for Onboarding
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connected-accounts/create-account-link?account_id={{accountId}}&refresh_url=http://localhost:5173/connected-accounts&return_url=http://localhost:5173/connected-accounts
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Add Bank Account to Connected Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connected-accounts/add-bank-account?account_id={{accountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "account_number": "1234567890",
  "routing_number": "110000000",
  "iban": "GB82WEST12345698765432",
  "bic": "DEUTDEFF",
  "currency": "USD",
  "country": "US",
  "account_holder_name": "Test Account",
  "account_holder_type": "individual"
}

### List External Accounts for Connected Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connected-accounts/{{accountId}}/external-accounts
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Set Default Connected Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connected-accounts/set-default?account_id={{accountId}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Get Supported Currencies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connected-accounts/supported-currencies

### Example Connected Account Response:
# {
#   "id": "acct_1234567890",
#   "type": "express",
#   "country": "US",
#   "email": "business@example.com",
#   "business_type": "individual",
#   "business_name": "Test Business",
#   "charges_enabled": true,
#   "payouts_enabled": true,
#   "details_submitted": true,
#   "requirements": {},
#   "created": 1641234567,
#   "is_default": false
# }

### Variables (set these in your environment or replace manually):
# @accountId = acct_1234567890
